          "Q3: Feasibility report completed and preliminary vendor selection.",
          "Q4: Successful closed-loop pilot implementation."
        ]
      },
      "impact": "medium",
      "difficulty": "low",
      "timeframe": "Within 6 months"
    },
    {
      "type": "incremental",
      "title": "Service Diversification into Regulatory Compliance Consulting",
      "rationale": "Leveraging the firm's legal expertise in complex white-collar defense to offer a new, adjacent service line focused on regulatory compliance advisory. This is an incremental step that minimizes market entry risk by utilizing existing talent and infrastructure.",
